!
! The instructions a debugging session ran (pawprint_rules.h PR3), in
! Trebago: insns(i) is what step i ran, and the total is their exact sum,
! from the first step. A sum past 64 bits is the pillar's refusal, never
! wrapped; a negative count is no count, and the sum is divided by 1 -
! min(1, how many there are), a division by zero, refused.
trebago stepped_insns
  in  insns(n)
  out total
  total = sum(i, insns(i)) / (1 - min(1, sum(i, min(1, max(0, 0 - insns(i))))))
end
